  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Bald Eagle Banding",
  "description": "Data Type: Birds; This theme contains coverages of bald eagle nest locations at which birds were banded and fitted with radio transmitters. It also includes calculated gross movement of the eagles from the nest where they were banded to the Copper River Delta. Scale is 1:63,360.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: Unknown",
